      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Ammo is made in the GregGuns Ammo Press, not in a GregTech Assembler. It has its own recipe map: bullets, shells, empty magazines and loaded magazines, each pressed from GregTech parts and gunpowder. Build the LV press and everything in this chapter becomes possible.\n\nIts hand recipe is like GregTech\u0027s own basic machines: an LV hull, a motor, a piston, conveyors, circuits and cable. Check NEI for the exact grid. The Steam press you may already own runs the same recipes more slowly.\n\n[note]A machine can run any recipe at or below its tier. The LV press covers every LV round and magazine; MV and HV presses are needed for later calibers.[/note]",
